  description: An axe the size of a doorway with a verdict already written - several
    verdicts, in fact, orbiting his shoulders in case the first one misses.
  tactics: 'Random rift crosses plus muzzle homing bolts (difficulty 6). The crosses
    claim diagonals from wherever a square opens - the moment one appears, note its
    lanes and leave them. Verdict (55%) adds sweeping walls and Zealot summons: kill
    the Zealots between wall passes.'
